              <p class="text-[28px] text-[#FFFFFF] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[16px]">1.500 €<span class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] font-normal">/Monat</span></p>
              <div class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] font-normal leading-[2]">
