              <p class="text-[28px] text-[#FFFFFF] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[16px]">6 bis 10 %<span class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.7)] font-normal"> des Budgets</span></p>
              <div class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] font-normal leading-[2]">
